# Aloware Talk 2 - Project Overview

This is a Quasar/Vue.js based application for Aloware Agent Interface, with both web and Electron desktop builds.

## Key Entry Points
- [App.vue](mdc:src/App.vue) - The main Vue application component
- [quasar.conf.js](mdc:quasar.conf.js) - Configuration for the Quasar framework
- [index.template.html](mdc:src/index.template.html) - HTML template for the application

## Project Structure
- `src/` - Main application code
  - `components/` - Reusable Vue components
  - `pages/` - Page-level Vue components
  - `layouts/` - Layout components
  - `store/` - Vuex store modules
  - `router/` - Vue router configuration
  - `boot/` - Initialization code that runs before the app
  - `utils/` - Helper utilities
  - `mixins/` - Vue mixins
  - `constants/` - Application constants
  - `css/` - Stylesheets
  - `assets/` - Static assets

## Build and Development
- Web app: `quasar dev` for development, `quasar build` for production
- Electron app: `quasar dev -m electron` for development
- See package.json for all scripts
